":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に説明すると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左2人がボケで、右2人がツッコミ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが終わったらみんなで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯いこーね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/08/18/1073922/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、残り 福岡・仙台・名古屋・神宮と頑張りますよー.(*♡´◡` 人´◡` ♡*)ﾟ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、お仕事いってきます！！"}],"source":"archive"}